				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>波間に　浮かぶ　建物が
島のように　みえる　リゾートシティ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-30T07:53:12" />
