				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>町の　始まりを　告げる
時計台が　シンボル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-30T08:07:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
