				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>最先端の　技術力が
注ぎこまれている　海底トンネル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-30T06:59:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
